      "content": "SP 81 SE         ASTON CLINTON              AYLESBURY ROAD                                             south side 5/2                                         No.62 _ _                                           II Cottage. C17 altered. Timber framed with white-painted brick infill, modern concrete tile roof, central brick chimney; 2 storeys, 2 bays, door to left, two 3-light casements to RH, one 2-light swept dormer and a second at eaves level. RH gable has small upper window with weatherboarding above, 2-light casement and door to RH of ground floor. Modern lean-to addition at rear. Listing NGR: SP8737012254"
    }
